How to set and reach training goals?\r\n\r\n	&nbsp;\r\n\r\n	PART 2: Soft Skills Training - key areas and case studies\r\n\r\n	Why &bdquo; Interpersonal Communication&rdquo; &amp; &bdquo;Negotiations&rdquo; are common topics for Soft Skills Trainings? \r\n\r\n	What are other &bdquo;trendy&rdquo; topics for Soft Skills Trainings?\r\n\r\n	What are the elements which make up a perfect CASE STUDY training soft skills?\r\n\r\n	\r\n	&nbsp;\r\n\r\n	PART 3: &ldquo;train the trainer&rdquo; - challenging moments in the profession of Soft Skills Trainer\r\n\r\n	How to build &ldquo;Soft Skills Trainee Profile&rdquo; ?\r\n\r\n	How to &bdquo;win&rdquo; people through Soft Skills Training so they become really involved in the training session?\r\n\r\n	How to overcome difficult moments and learn from the feedback?\r\n\r\n	What is &bdquo;difficult trainee syndrome&rdquo;?\r\n\r\n	\r\n	&nbsp;\r\n\r\n	PART 4: Negotiating fair trainer rates\r\n\r\n	soft skills in your profession: negotiations of Trainer Rates- how to negotiate best possible rates for running the trainings? Short Introduction into the area of negotiation as well as trainer rates negotiations case studies\r\n\r\n	&nbsp;\r\n\r\n	Training aims:\r\n\r\n	developing understanding of the profession of Soft Skills Trainer\r\n\r\n	analysing main areas of Soft Skills Training\r\n\r\n	broadening the knowledge of holding professional training sessions\r\n\r\n	practising the art. of preparing and evaluating &bdquo;needs and requirement analysis&rdquo;\r\n\r\n	analysing own training abilities\r\n\r\n	practising the art. of negotiating trainer rates\r\n\r\n	&nbsp;\r\n\r\n	what is included in the price?\r\n\r\n	\r\n		\r\n			9 hours of training session\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		\r\n			training materials from the area of the Methodology of Soft Skills Training &amp; Trainer Rates Negotiations Case Studies\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		\r\n			catering\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		\r\n			Soft Skills Trainer Certificate\r\n	\r\n	\r\n		\r\n			after-training online consultations\r\n	\r\n', 'product_image/20112010_WARSZAWA_SOFT_SKILLS_TRAINER_Trener_umiejetnosci_miekkich_w_jezyku_angielskim_-_szkolenie_trenerskie_logo3_s.jpg', 'product_image/20112010_WARSZAWA_SOFT_SKILLS_TRAINER_Trener_umiejetnosci_miekkich_w_jezyku_angielskim_-_szkolenie_trenerskie_logo3.jpg', NULL, 395.0000, 5, 15, 'ACTIVE'),
